source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: U+200B after a token does not suppress the icon, but jiro never writes one to force it.
-- input.jira --
(x)​foo
-- rendered.html --
<p><img class="emoticon" src="/jira/images/icons/emoticons/error.png" height="16" width="16" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/>​foo</p>
-- want.md --
:emoticon[(x)]​foo
-- warnings.json --
[]
